stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SavePrompt
    SavePrompt --> CheckBudget
    CheckBudget --> RequestModel: fewer than 500 rounds used
    CheckBudget --> Stopped: budget exhausted
    RequestModel --> SaveReply: complete reply received
    RequestModel --> Stopped: provider error or interruption
    SaveReply --> Answer: no tool calls
    SaveReply --> ValidateCall: tool calls present
    ValidateCall --> CheckPermission: valid tool and arguments
    ValidateCall --> SaveResult: invalid call produces an error
    CheckPermission --> Execute: allowed or approved
    CheckPermission --> SaveResult: denied produces an error
    Execute --> SaveResult: success or tool failure
    Execute --> RecordInterrupted: Ctrl+C
    RecordInterrupted --> Stopped: record unresolved calls, effects may be partial
    SaveResult --> ValidateCall: another call in this reply
    SaveResult --> CheckBudget: all calls have results
    Answer --> [*]
    Stopped --> [*]
